ve (calling)"],"JX":["보조사 (은/는, 도, 만…)","topic/focus particle (as for, also, only…)"],"VCP":["서술격 조사 (이다)","copula (to be)"],"VV":["동사","verb"],"VX":["보조 용언","auxiliary verb"],"XSN":["명사 파생 접미사 (들, 쯤, 씩…)","noun suffix (plural, about, each…)"]}}